{
  "$schema": "../../docs/builder.schema.json",
  "template": {
    "title": "Service business",
    "description": "For a local business or agency: services, reasons to choose you, testimonials, contact details and FAQ."
  },
  "version": 1,
  "layout": "site",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "st035",
      "type": "section",
      "style": {
        "padding": {
          "base": "xl",
          "mobile": "lg"
        },
        "text": "center",
        "width": "narrow"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "ct034",
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wt031",
              "type": "heading",
              "tag": "h1",
              "size": "2xl",
              "kicker": {
                "id": "Jasa profesional",
                "en": "Professional services"
              },
              "text": {
                "id": "Kami bantu urusan Anda selesai dengan rapi.",
                "en": "We get your job done properly."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wt032",
              "type": "text",
              "size": "lg",
              "html": {
                "id": "<p>Ceritakan singkat layanan Anda, area yang dilayani, dan kenapa pelanggan bisa percaya.</p>",
                "en": "<p>Briefly describe your service, the area you cover, and why customers can trust you.</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wt033",
              "type": "button",
              "buttons": [
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Konsultasi gratis",
                    "en": "Free consultation"
                  },
                  "url": "#kontak"
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Lihat layanan",
                    "en": "See services"
                  },
                  "url": "#layanan",
                  "variant": "outline"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "st039",
      "type": "section",
      "anchor": "layanan",
      "style": {
        "background": "muted",
        "text": "center"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "ct038",
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wt036",
              "type": "heading",
              "text": {
                "id": "Layanan kami",
                "en": "Our services"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wt037",
              "type": "card",
              "margin": "md",
              "columns": {
                "base": "3",
                "tablet": "2",
                "mobile": "1"
              },
              "cards": [
                {
                  "title": {
                    "id": "Konsultasi",
                    "en": "Consulting"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Kami pelajari kebutuhan Anda lebih dulu.",
                    "en": "We learn what you need first."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "title": {
                    "id": "Pengerjaan",
                    "en": "Delivery"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Dikerjakan tim berpengalaman, tepat waktu.",
                    "en": "Done by an experienced team, on time."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "title": {
                    "id": "Perawatan",
                    "en": "Maintenance"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Kami tetap mendampingi setelah selesai.",
                    "en": "We stay with you after it is done."
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "st044",
      "type": "section",
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "ct041",
          "width": {
            "base": 5,
            "tablet": 12
          },
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wt040",
              "type": "heading",
              "text": {
                "id": "Kenapa memilih kami",
                "en": "Why choose us"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ct043",
          "width": {
            "base": 7,
            "tablet": 12
          },
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wt042",
              "type": "icon-list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "title": {
                    "id": "Berpengalaman",
                    "en": "Experienced"
